    "Languages choose the tracks at the start of each title. On a title’s page, Audio and Subtitles choose others: Mira keeps them for the next episodes of the series. These choices are kept on your Jellyfin, with the tracks of each series and the titles taken out of Continue watching: you find them on Mira web, Windows and Mac.": {
